I'd suggest getting Excalibur. It's a fine weapon that's easily acquired in 
the early game. For a second weapon I'd suggest a crysknife but that's a 
late game object or you come across it when you kill your first long worm. 
Excalibur is easily ditched when you get the Tsurugugugig or however it's 
spelled. Keep in mind that Excalibur confers level-drain resistance, 
searching and does nice damage. The Tsurugi is a luckstone that may slice 
your medium sized or smaller opponent in half.

